WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:03.300
Open the party screen with /viscript_team party

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.500
Enter a name; the creator becomes party leader

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.400
Chat is party-only; its history does not survive a server restart

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:24.800
Party friendly fire is off by default; the switch applies immediately
